
I am developing an enterprise grade quick commerce app based in NodeJS, MongoDB, Postgres, and react.
Idea is to create a complete app to brush my development skill.
This app will have 4 main component
1. User facing webapp, from where customer would be interacting
2. Warehouse webapp, where all the order packging part would be maanged
3. Admin back office kind of dashboard for analytics and tracking
We would be developing all the required systems to make this whole app running in nodejs be it authentication system, order management,
product catalogue service, payment system, warehouse management, dashboard, customer support in microservice fashion.
Frontend would be primarily in ReactJS.

“You are an experienced software architect specializing in open-source web applications. Your task is to generate a series of detailed prompts to guide the development of this quick commerce delivery app. The  app should focus on speed and ease of use for both customers and administrators.

# Quick Commerce App Architecture & Development Guide

## System Architecture Overview

1. **Microservices Backend**:
   - Authentication Service
   - Product Catalog Service
   - Order Management Service
   - Payment Processing Service
   - Warehouse Management Service
   - Analytics & Reporting Service
   - Customer Support Service
   - Notification Service

2. **Frontend Applications**:
   - Customer-facing Web Application
   - Warehouse Management Interface
   - Administrative Dashboard

3. **Database Layer**:
   - MongoDB for product catalog, user profiles
   - PostgreSQL for transactional data, orders, payments
   - Redis for caching and session management

4. **DevOps Components**:
   - CI/CD pipeline
   - Containerization with Docker
   - Container orchestration with Kubernetes
   - API Gateway for routing

Now, let's break down the development into structured prompts:

## 1. Project Setup & Infrastructure

Begin by setting up the development environment and establishing the core infrastructure:

- Initialize a monorepo structure using Lerna or Nx
- Set up Docker and docker-compose for local development
- Configure CI/CD pipelines with GitHub Actions or similar
- Establish base configuration for microservices
- Create shared libraries for common functionality
- Configure database connections and initial schemas

## 2. Authentication Service

This service will handle user authentication, registration, and authorization:

- Implement JWT-based authentication
- Design user roles (customer, warehouse staff, admin)
- Create secure password handling with bcrypt
- Implement social login options
- Design refresh token mechanism
- Add 2FA capability
- Build password reset flow
- Create profile management endpoints

## 3. Product Catalog Service

This service will manage all product-related functionality:

- Create product schema with variants, categories, and attributes
- Implement inventory tracking
- Design search and filtering capabilities
- Build product recommendation system
- Implement product image management
- Create product review and rating system
- Build category management
- Design product promotion handling

## 4. Order Management Service

This service will handle the entire order lifecycle:

- Create order creation flow
- Implement order status tracking
- Design order modification capabilities
- Build order history and retrieval
- Implement order cancellation flow
- Create delivery time estimation logic
- Design order analytics and reporting
- Build returns and refunds processing

## 5. Payment Processing Service

This service will handle all payment-related functionality:

- Integrate with payment gateways (Stripe, PayPal)
- Implement secure payment processing
- Design payment status tracking
- Build payment verification system
- Create refund processing
- Implement invoice generation
- Design payment analytics
- Build payment failure handling

## 6. Warehouse Management Service

This service will handle inventory and order fulfillment:

- Create inventory management system
- Implement pick and pack workflow
- Design warehouse zone management
- Build packing optimization algorithms
- Implement delivery assignment
- Create inventory forecasting
- Design warehouse staff management
- Build quality control checkpoints

## 7. Analytics & Reporting Service

This service will provide business insights and reporting:

- Implement data aggregation pipelines
- Design dashboard metrics and KPIs
- Create sales and revenue reporting
- Build customer behavior analytics
- Implement inventory turnover analysis
- Design delivery performance metrics
- Create custom report generation
- Build real-time monitoring capabilities

## 8. Customer Support Service

This service will handle customer inquiries and support:

- Implement ticket management system
- Design chat support functionality
- Build FAQ and self-service options
- Create order issue resolution flow
- Implement customer feedback collection
- Design support agent interface
- Build automated response system
- Create escalation workflows

## 9. Notification Service

This service will manage all communications:

- Implement email notification system
- Create SMS notification capabilities
- Design in-app notification center
- Build push notification service
- Implement notification preferences
- Create notification templates
- Design scheduled notifications
- Build notification analytics

## 10. Customer-facing Web Application

This React application will serve your end customers:

- Create responsive UI with Tailwind CSS
- Implement user registration and login flow
- Design product browsing and searching
- Build shopping cart functionality
- Implement checkout process
- Create order tracking interface
- Design user profile management
- Build payment method management
- Implement reviews and ratings UI
- Create wishlist functionality

## 11. Warehouse Management Interface

This React application will be used by warehouse staff:

- Create order processing dashboard
- Implement inventory management interface
- Design picking and packing workflow UI
- Build delivery assignment interface
- Create return processing screens
- Design staff performance metrics
- Implement quality control checklists
- Build warehouse layout visualization

## 12. Administrative Dashboard

This React application will serve your business administrators:

- Create analytics dashboard with charts
- Implement user management interface
- Design product catalog management
- Build order management capabilities
- Create promotion and discount management
- Design warehouse performance monitoring
- Implement customer support overview
- Build system configuration interface
- Create financial reporting tools

## 13. Integration & Testing

Ensure your system works as a cohesive whole:

- Implement API gateway with Kong or similar
- Create service-to-service communication
- Build end-to-end testing suite
- Implement performance testing
- Design security testing approach
- Create automated integration tests
- Build smoke and regression tests
- Implement monitoring and logging

## 14. Deployment & DevOps

Prepare your application for production:

- Configure Kubernetes clusters
- Implement database backups
- Design high-availability architecture
- Create auto-scaling policies
- Implement blue-green deployment
- Design disaster recovery plan
- Build monitoring and alerting system
- Create infrastructure as code

